  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "DirectAdmin is a Linux hosting control panel (JBMC Software) licensed per server — not managed WordPress hosting. Personal Plus publishes at $5/month; Lite $15; Standard $29 with unlimited accounts/domains on published packaging. Same hosting-operations cluster as Plesk and cPanel. Plesk remains the cluster award (7.4); this entity does not outrank it. Landscape-only versus Kinsta/WP Engine managed hosting.",
